 "body": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Mae Ploy Coconut Milk\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/maeploy.jpg\" width=\"60\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Mae Ploy Coconut Milk\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/chaokoh.jpg\" width=\"55\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Coconut milk</strong><br/>\n<em>Mae Ploy</em> – 19 oz.<br/>\n<em>Chaokoh</em> – 14 oz.</td>\n<td> </td>\n<td><strong>Roasted chilli paste</strong><br/>\n<em>Butterfly Brand</em> or <em>Mae Ploy</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Green Curry Paste\" height=\"64\" src=\"/images/greencur.jpg\" width=\"55\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Massaman Curry Paste\" height=\"63\" src=\"/images/massaman.jpg\" width=\"56\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Curry Paste</strong><br/>\n<em>Mae Ploy</em> – 14 oz. tubs</td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Nang Fah Fried Shallots\" height=\"65\" src=\"/images/fryshalp.jpg\" width=\"57\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Fried Shallots</strong><br/>\n<em>Nang Fah (Tue Kung)</em> brand distributed by V. Thai Food Products</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Fish Sauces\" height=\"125\" src=\"/images/fishsauces.jpg\" width=\"151\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Fish Sauce</strong><br/>\n<em>Golden Boy</em> (best)<br/>\n<em>Tra Chang</em> (best)<br/>\n<em>King Crab</em> (good)<br/>\n<em>Squid</em> (good)</td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Klong Kohn Shrimp Paste\" height=\"76\" src=\"/images/klongk.jpg\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Klong Kohn Shrimp Paste\" height=\"46\" src=\"/images/klongksm.jpg\" width=\"44\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Shrimp paste</strong><br/>\n<em>Klong Kohn</em> or <em>Klong Kon</em> (\"Packed &amp; distributed by P. Prateepthong.\") – look for the big green shrimp.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Dragonfly Super Premium Oyster Sauce\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/oys1th.jpg\" width=\"49\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Dragonfly Oyster Sauce\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/dfly1.gif\" width=\"49\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Mae Krua Oyster Sauce\" height=\"125\" src=\"/images/maekruath.jpg\" width=\"39\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Oyster sauce</strong><br/>\n<em>Dragonfly <strong>Super Premium Flavored</strong></em> (best)<br/>\n        or <em>Dragonfly</em> Premium<br/>\n        or <em>\"Mae Krua\"</em></td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Black Soy Sauce\" height=\"125\" src=\"/images/soyblacks.jpg\" width=\"87\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Dark or Black Soy Sauce</strong><br/>\n<em>Dragonfly</em> – made by Kwong Hung Seng (check back label)<br/>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Text\" height=\"22\" src=\"/images/bsoytxt.jpg\" width=\"122\"/></figure></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Peanut Oil\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/peanoilp.jpg\" width=\"63\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Peanut oil</strong><br/>\n<em>Lion and Globe</em></td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Dragonfly Salted Soybean Sauce\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/dflysoyyel.jpg\" width=\"45\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Yellow Soy Bean Sauce</strong><br/>\n<em>\"Dragonfly Salted Soybean Sauce.\"</em></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Jasmine Rice\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/jasricep.gif\" width=\"59\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Jasmine Rice Label\" height=\"65\" src=\"/images/jasrice2.gif\" width=\"90\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Jasmine rice</strong><br/>\n<em>Golden Phoenix.</em></td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Thin Soy Sauce\" height=\"100\" src=\"/images/soythins.jpg\" width=\"50\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>\"Light\" or \"Thin\" Soy Sauce</strong><br/>\n<em>Koon Chun</em> brand<br/>\n<figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Text\" height=\"22\" src=\"/images/thsoytxt.jpg\" width=\"100\"/></figure></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Sanpatong Sticky Rice\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/sanpatongp.jpg\" width=\"54\"/></figure> <figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Sanpatong Label\" height=\"65\" src=\"/images/sanpatongs2.jpg\" width=\"78\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>White Sticky Rice</strong><br/>\n<em>Sanpatong</em> (pictured)<br/>\n<em>Golden Phoenix</em><br/>\n<em>Butterfly</em></td>\n<td><figure class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Thin Soy Sauce\" height=\"85\" src=\"/images/shark1.jpg\" width=\"33\"/></figure></td>\n<td><strong>Sriracha Chilli Sauce</strong><br/>\n        Shark brand, or one without additives or preservatives.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p><strong>www.thaifoodandtravel.com/brands.html</strong></p>",
